a pretty elegant solution would be to just yank all the arguments down and slap them inside an array destructuring pattern (after replacing the references to closed-over variables). so this:
```ts
function Component() {
  const value = 3
  const obj = {}
  async function closure({ x = value } = obj, y = x) {
    'use server'
    return [x, y]
  }
  ...
}
```

